{"case_id": "LV-FY2027Q1-OI-BRIDGE-001", "event_family_id": "LV-FY2027Q1-non-ifrs", "question_origin": "derived_from_management_discussion", "company": "Lenovo", "fiscal_year": 2027, "fiscal_quarter": 1, "period_end": "2026-06-30", "publication_date": "2026-08-13", "query": "联想 FY2027Q1 经调整经营溢利 15.23 亿美元、同比 +141%，但呈报经营溢利只有 0.19 亿美元、同比 -98%。两者是否矛盾？请用公告的非 HKFRS 调节项把两个口径对上，并把呈报经营溢利的同比变化 -7.66 亿美元分解为各调节项变动之和，指出哪些项是非现金项目。", "sources": [{"pdf": "FY27Q1_130820261201.pdf", "url": "https://www1.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2026/0813/2026081300142_c.pdf", "sha256": "337d22412402e35a7d4c1ca2b01e19e30ec409ad503b148765e55ee1c4d0f0ec", "pdf_pages": [1, 2, 5, 9], "printed_pages": [1, 2, 5, 9], "section": "财务摘要；财务回顾；使用非香港财务报告准则计量调节表"}], "management_reference": {"paraphrase": "管理层将经调整经营溢利定义呈报经营溢利剔除认股权证公允值变动、FVTPL 金融资产变动、并购无形摊销等七类项目后的口径，p2 称呈报亏损主要由 2025 年发行认股权证重估产生 17 亿美元非现金公允值亏损，重估主要反映股价变动，属非现金会计项目。", "evidence_spans": [{"pdf_page": 2, "quote": "已呈報的權益持有人應佔虧損為6.09億美元，主要由二零二五年發行的認股權證重估產生17億美元非現金公允值虧損"}, {"pdf_page": 9, "quote": "與認股權證相關的衍生金融負債公允值虧損 1,690,299"}]}, "required_inputs": [{"metric": "operating_income_reported", "entity": "Lenovo 集团", "period": "FY2027Q1 单季", "raw_value": "19,202 千美元", "raw_unit": "usd_kn", "unified_value": 19.202, "unified_unit": "usd_mn", "scope": "单季", "version": "original", "source": {"pdf": "FY27Q1_130820261201.pdf", "pdf_pages": [9]}, "db": {"location": "facts.account_code='operating_income'", "value": 19.202, "status": "match"}}, {"metric": "operating_income_reported", "entity": "Lenovo 集团", "period": "FY2026Q1 单季", "raw_value": "784,809 千美元", "raw_unit": "usd_kn", "unified_value": 784.809, "unified_unit": "usd_mn", "scope": "单季", "version": "original", "source": {"pdf": "FY27Q1_130820261201.pdf", "pdf_pages": [9]}, "db": {"location": "facts", "value": 784.809, "status": "match"}}, {"metric": "adjusted_operating_income", "entity": "Lenovo 集团", "period": "FY2027Q1 / FY2026Q1", "raw_value": "1,522,683 / 631,046 千美元", "raw_unit": "usd_kn", "unif